    "period": "June 2025",
    "idiom": "Box plot"
  },
  "description": "Dairy\u2019s non-employing share spans about 48\u201378% across eligible states. Pale boxes hold the middle half of state shares; the dark line is the median. Larger dots show individual states, offset vertically for visibility; only horizontal position represents percentage. Each state counts equally. Include \u2265100 businesses and \u22655 eligible states per sector. Owners and family may still work."
